  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2010 allocation of the Accompanying Measures for Sugar Protocol Countries (AMS) for Belize</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to reduce poverty and improve the living standards of the rural population in the northern, sugarcane region of Belize.  This will be achieved through the provision of support to three distinct project components.  The project aims at supporting a more competitive and diversified sugar cane industry which is stable and exists in a sounder physical environment. Secondly, the project will improve the physical access and communications links in northern Be</narrative>
  </description>
